     ],
     "value": "Homodimer (By similarity). Interacts with GPR89; the interaction stabilizes GPR89 (By similarity). Interacts with RAP1GDS1 (PubMed:31406347). Interacts (GDP-bound) with RAB11A (GTP-bound); the interaction stabilizes RABL3 and regulates ciliary vesicle formation during early ciliogenesis (PubMed:36052645)"
