      "value": "Disease susceptibility is associated with variants affecting the gene represented in this entry. RABL3 variants have been found in families with a history of pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma and multiple other occurrences of cancer, including melanoma, breast cancer, prostate cancer, and colon cancer"
